# Magic Square XX — Project

## Overview

- **Name:** Magic_Square_XX
- **Purpose:** 4×4 Magic Square Dual-Track TDD practice — layer separation, contract-based tests, refactoring over algorithm difficulty.
- **Python:** 3.10+

## SSOT (read before implementing)

- `Report/01.Magic_Square_Problem_Definition_Report.md`
- `Report/02.Magic_Square_TDD_Clean_Architecture_Design_Report.md`

## Problem scope

| Item | Rule |
|------|------|
| Grid | 4×4; values 0 or 1–16; exactly 2 zeros (empty cells); no duplicate non-zero |
| Output | `int[6] = [r1,c1,n1,r2,c2,n2]`; coordinates **1-indexed** |
| Magic constant | 34 |
| Scan order | Row-major (1,1) to (4,4) for empty-cell order |
| Placement | Try A (n_small, n_large) then B; output per Report/02 |

## Test tracks

- **Domain:** DT-* (entity layer)
- **Boundary:** UT-* (boundary layer; DomainSolverPort mock only)
- **Integration:** IT-*, IT-DATA-*

